# adven.dat LOC 79's own room text.  LOC 79 is a forced-motion location
# ("79 3 1" -- motion word 1, straight back to the well house) with no
# other travel row at all, so unlike LOC 16/21/26/40/59 it cannot be
# modelled as a room the player stands in: there would be no word to
# type to leave it.  It is a bounce instead, like LOC 22 and LOC 32 --
# adventure.am1's bldSewerBounce prints this and re-enters LOC 3.
