YOU ARE ON ONE SIDE OF A LARGE, DEEP CHASM.\n
A HEAVY WHITE MIST RISING UP FROM BELOW OBSCURES ALL VIEW OF THE FAR SIDE.\n
A SW PATH LEADS AWAY FROM THE CHASM INTO A WINDING CORRIDOR.
@
message CHASM_SW_SHORT
YOU'RE ON SW SIDE OF CHASM.
@
