@
message READ_TABLET
"CONGRATULATIONS ON BRINGING LIGHT INTO THE DARK-ROOM!"
@
message KNIFE_VANISH
THE DWARVES' KNIVES VANISH AS THEY STRIKE THE WALLS OF THE CAVE.
@
message FIND_HERE
