@
message CHAIN_LOCK_OK
THE CHAIN IS NOW LOCKED.
@
message ATTACK_BEAR_FEROCIOUS
WITH WHAT?\n
YOUR BARE HANDS?\n
AGAINST *HIS* BEAR HANDS??
@
message ATTACK_BEAR_TAME
THE BEAR IS CONFUSED; HE ONLY WANTS TO BE YOUR FRIEND.
@
message ATTACK_DWARF
WITH WHAT?  YOUR BARE HANDS?
@
message ATTACK_SNAKE
ATTACKING THE SNAKE BOTH DOESN'T WORK AND IS VERY DANGEROUS.
@
message ATTACK_TROLL
TROLLS ARE CLOSE RELATIVES WITH THE ROCKS AND HAVE SKIN AS TOUGH AS\n
THAT OF A RHINOCEROS.  THE TROLL FENDS OFF YOUR BLOWS EFFORTLESSLY.
@
message ATTACK_SHELL
THE SHELL IS VERY STRONG AND IS IMPERVIOUS TO ATTACK.
@
message BEAR_TROLL_BYPASS
THE BEAR LUMBERS TOWARD THE TROLL, WHO LETS OUT A STARTLED SHRIEK AND\n
SCURRIES AWAY.\n
THE BEAR SOON GIVES UP THE PURSUIT AND WANDERS BACK.
@
message CHASM_NO_LONGER
