@
message BEAR_CROSSING_DEATH
JUST AS YOU REACH THE OTHER SIDE, THE BRIDGE BUCKLES BENEATH THE WEIGHT OF\n
THE BEAR, WHICH WAS STILL FOLLOWING YOU AROUND.\n
YOU SCRABBLE DESPERATELY FOR SUPPORT, BUT AS THE BRIDGE COLLAPSES YOU\n
STUMBLE BACK AND FALL INTO THE CHASM.
@
