message WELCOME_ASK
WELCOME TO ADVENTURE!!  WOULD YOU LIKE INSTRUCTIONS?
@
message INSTRUCTIONS
SOMEWHERE NEARBY IS COLOSSAL CAVE, WHERE OTHERS HAVE FOUND FORTUNES IN\n
TREASURE AND GOLD, THOUGH IT IS RUMORED THAT SOME WHO ENTER ARE NEVER\n
SEEN AGAIN.  MAGIC IS SAID TO WORK IN THE CAVE.  I WILL BE YOUR EYES\n
AND HANDS.  DIRECT ME WITH COMMANDS OF 1 OR 2 WORDS.  I SHOULD WARN\n
YOU THAT I LOOK AT ONLY THE FIRST FIVE LETTERS OF EACH WORD, SO YOU'LL\n
HAVE TO ENTER "NORTHEAST" AS "NE" TO DISTINGUISH IT FROM "NORTH".\n
(SHOULD YOU GET STUCK, TYPE "HELP" FOR SOME GENERAL HINTS.\n
FOR INFORMATION ON HOW TO END YOUR ADVENTURE, ETC., TYPE "INFO".)
                              - - -
THIS PROGRAM WAS ORIGINALLY DEVELOPED BY WILLIE CROWTHER.\n
MOST OF THE FEATURES OF THE CURRENT PROGRAM WERE ADDED BY\n
DON WOODS (DON @ SU-AI).\n
CONTACT DON IF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS, COMMENTS, ETC.\n
THIS PDP-1 VERSION WAS DEVELOPED IN 2026 BY BILL EZELL (WJE@QUACKERS.NET).
@
message OBIT1
OH DEAR, YOU SEEM TO HAVE GOTTEN YOURSELF KILLED.\n
I MIGHT BE ABLE TO HELP YOU OUT, BUT I'VE NEVER REALLY DONE THIS BEFORE.\n
DO YOU WANT ME TO TRY TO REINCARNATE YOU?
@
message REVIVE1
ALL RIGHT.  BUT DON'T BLAME ME IF SOMETHING GOES WR......\n
                    --- POOF!! ---\n
YOU ARE ENGULFED IN A CLOUD OF ORANGE SMOKE.\n
COUGHING AND GASPING, YOU EMERGE FROM THE SMOKE AND FIND....
@
message OBIT2
YOU CLUMSY OAF, YOU'VE DONE IT AGAIN!\n
I DON'T KNOW HOW LONG I CAN KEEP THIS UP.\n
DO YOU WANT ME TO TRY REINCARNATING YOU AGAIN?
@
message REVIVE2
OKAY, NOW WHERE DID I PUT MY ORANGE SMOKE?....  >POOF!<\n
EVERYTHING DISAPPEARS IN A DENSE CLOUD OF ORANGE SMOKE.
@
message OBIT3
NOW YOU'VE REALLY DONE IT!  I'M OUT OF ORANGE SMOKE!\n
YOU DON'T EXPECT ME TO DO A DECENT REINCARNATION WITHOUT\n
ANY ORANGE SMOKE, DO YOU?
@
message REVIVE3
OKAY, IF YOU'RE SO SMART, DO IT YOURSELF!  I'M LEAVING!
@
message HINT_OFFER
DO YOU WANT THE HINT?
@
message HINT_CAVE_Q
ARE YOU TRYING TO GET INTO THE CAVE?
@
message HINT_CAVE
THE GRATE IS VERY SOLID AND HAS A HARDENED STEEL LOCK.\n
YOU CANNOT ENTER WITHOUT A KEY, AND THERE ARE NO KEYS NEARBY.\n
I WOULD RECOMMEND LOOKING ELSEWHERE FOR THE KEYS.
@
message HINT_BIRD_Q
ARE YOU TRYING TO CATCH THE BIRD?
@
message HINT_BIRD
SOMETHING SEEMS TO BE FRIGHTENING THE BIRD JUST NOW AND YOU CANNOT\n
CATCH IT NO MATTER WHAT YOU TRY.\n
PERHAPS YOU MIGHT TRY LATER.
@
message HINT_SNAKE_Q
ARE YOU TRYING TO SOMEHOW DEAL WITH THE SNAKE?
@
message HINT_SNAKE
YOU CAN'T KILL THE SNAKE, OR DRIVE IT AWAY, OR AVOID IT,\n
OR ANYTHING LIKE THAT.\n
THERE IS A WAY TO GET BY, BUT YOU DON'T HAVE THE NECESSARY\n
RESOURCES RIGHT NOW.
@
