"THIS EXIT IS CLOSED.\n
PLEASE LEAVE VIA MAIN OFFICE."
@
message CLOSING_DEATH
IT LOOKS AS THOUGH YOU'RE DEAD.\n
WELL, SEEING AS HOW IT'S SO CLOSE TO CLOSING TIME ANYWAY,\n
I THINK WE'LL JUST CALL IT A DAY.
@
