# TASK-FR4 item 4f (06-Sep-26, S46).  `108 95556 43 45 46 47 48 49 50 29
# 30` gives NINE words the same 95% "you wound up back in the main
# passage" roll, and `108 106 43` is the 5% fall-through for every one of
