verb SHAZA voc shaza msgref FR8_MAGIC_WORD_WORN_OUT handler doSpeak
verb HOCUS voc hocus msgref FR8_MAGIC_WORD_WORN_OUT handler doSpeak
verb POCUS voc pocus msgref FR8_MAGIC_WORD_WORN_OUT handler doSpeak
